Asian arts, crafts, and specialty goods shops;
Bakeries;
Banks;
Barbecue shops;
Bookstores;
Coffee shops;
Floral shops;
Groceries;
Museums;
Personal services such as beauty shops and barbershops;
Restaurants;
Sidewalk cafes;
Tea shops;
Travel agencies;
Variety stores.
